<title>USA: Weatherford Enterra sells pipeline assets.</title>
<headline>Weatherford Enterra sells pipeline assets.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Weatherford Enterra Inc said it has sold its CRC-Evans Pipeline assets and business to privately held CEPI Holdings Inc for undisclosed terms.</p>
<p>Based in Houston, Texas, CRC-Evans designs, manufactures and services specialized pipeline construction and automatic welding equipment, which it rents and sells.</p>
<p>Weatherford Enterra is a diversified international energy service and manufacturing company.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
